<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SimpleLicensing/customIdToLicense> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Maps a \"LicenseRef-\" string for a custom license or a \"AdditionRef-\" string for\na custom license addition to a `CustomLicense`, a `CustomLicenseAddition`, or a\n`SimpleLicensingText`."@en .
